<title>POLAND: Agros full group results for 1996.</title>
<headline>Agros full group results for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agros final group results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    group operating profit		    85.29   vs   60.44</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit			85.18   vs   80.25</p>
<p>    group net profit			    59.10   vs   49.41</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Agros Holding SA.</p>
<p>    group net sales			  1,390.49   vs  995.42</p>
<p>    group costs of sales		   1,142.55   vs  789.05</p>
<p>    group extraordinary loss		  32.26   vs    0.05</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    group income tax			    18.99   vs   23.43</p>
<p>    group other taxes				na   vs    0.03</p>
<p>    group financial revenues		  79.81   vs   60.12</p>
<p>    group financial costs		     67.76   vs   55.84</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
